 "commanders": [
  "King T'Challa // Black Panther, Hope Enduring"
 ],
 "format": "Commander",
 "name": "King T'Challa: Diplomatic Immunity",
 "notes": [
  "Plan: King T'Challa has flash and draws you a card whenever any player draws their second card in a turn. Give everyone a second card every turn (Howling Mine, Dictate of Kruphix, Jace Beleren) and you draw on every turn at the table.",
  "Best single cards: Vision Skeins on an opponent's turn makes all four players draw two, which is up to four triggers for two mana. Words of Wisdom on an opponent's turn is two triggers. Super Intelligence on one of your own creatures gives you a second draw each upkeep.",
  "Reed Richards, Smartest Man turns your first extra draw each turn into four cards.",
  "Finishers: transform T'Challa for {4}{W}{U} into Black Panther, Hope Enduring (flash, double strike, takes no damage, draws on a hit) and give him evasion with Iron Man Armor, Whispersilk Cloak, Falcon's Wing Harness or Rogue's Passage. Backups: Shang-Chi and the Ten Rings, Ms. Marvel, Psychosis Crawler, Triskaidekaphile.",
  "You are feeding the table cards. Hold counterspells for the things those cards find, and keep Propaganda out early.",
  "Owner is set to Andrew for now; this was suggested as a second Marvel deck for your wife.",
  "Ownership tags on each card: have = confirmed owned; freed = from a deck folded Nov 16 or a precon cut; likely = Marvel common or uncommon, or your staples pile; check = owned but maybe sleeved elsewhere; buy = not known to be owned.",
  "Buy list (Nov 12 snapshot): about $17 for the 18 buy cards. Estimated, not simulated: wins around turns 9-11.",
  "Bracket 2 check: 0 Game Changers, no extra turns, no land destruction, no infinite combo, no tutors."
 ],
 "order": 5.7,
